OL,3,ABehaviour guidelines for life in UK
OL,4,Apublished for asylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Home Office spokesman said: "We
OL,7,Fexpect everyone who comes to the UK to
OL,8,Fabide by our laws. If they do not, they
OL,9,Fwill face consequences, including the
OL,10,Frefusal of their asylum claim and
OL,11,Fremoval from the UK."
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
